1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Eighth Episode
The Black Knight

15
00:01:58,021 --> 00:02:00,296
So..
According to what is written here,

16
00:02:00,341 --> 00:02:04,414
"a fighting dog is a dog
that only knows fighting.

17
00:02:04,461 --> 00:02:07,771
It is a dog that has been kept
away from its mother since it was a puppy..

18
00:02:07,821 --> 00:02:10,733
...and forced to become
autonomous and independent.

19
00:02:11,341 --> 00:02:14,777
It only knows how to fight
and knows neither pain nor joy"

20
00:02:18,181 --> 00:02:21,093
It certainly isn't nice
not feeling emotions... yeah.

21
00:02:25,741 --> 00:02:28,619
- Good morning, Doctor Uranaru!
- Good morning.

22
00:02:28,821 --> 00:02:31,381
- What are you reading?
"What is interesting...

23
00:02:31,421 --> 00:02:33,651
...is that the only thing
he has on his mind is the enemy,

24
00:02:33,701 --> 00:02:36,499
meaning he thinks of nothing else
but succeeding in defeating him."

25
00:02:36,541 --> 00:02:38,452
But who are you talking about?

26
00:02:38,501 --> 00:02:41,459
Him! Don't you see?
He is a fighting dog,

27
00:02:41,501 --> 00:02:43,890
meaning a dog
that doesn't feel emotions.

28
00:02:45,221 --> 00:02:48,850
Help, he's after me!
Easy! Easy! Be good!

29
00:02:49,181 --> 00:02:52,173
But... But this is the dog
of Grand Duke Duralumin!

30
00:02:52,781 --> 00:02:56,774
I don't believe there are animals that feel
neither emotions nor feelings!

31
00:02:56,821 --> 00:02:59,733
Any animal
understands if we love it!

32
00:02:59,781 --> 00:03:03,296
Come here, big dog!
Did you see, Princess?

33
00:03:03,341 --> 00:03:06,811
I was right! Look
how docile this little dog is!

34
00:03:06,861 --> 00:03:09,455
He's so docile and tame!

35
00:03:13,501 --> 00:03:15,412
Help!

36
00:03:16,261 --> 00:03:19,492
What were you doing
to my puppy, Doctor Uranaru?

37
00:03:20,301 --> 00:03:23,498
Grand Duke Duralumin!
You should keep him in a kennel!

38
00:03:23,541 --> 00:03:26,294
This puppy of yours
seems rather dangerous!

39
00:03:28,341 --> 00:03:31,014
What's the matter, little dear?

40
00:03:31,061 --> 00:03:34,497
If someone is crazy enough to get
bitten by such a sweet little dog,

41
00:03:34,541 --> 00:03:37,419
too bad for him!
Anyway, later, I will show you

42
00:03:37,461 --> 00:03:39,531
- a very funny thing!
- Funny?

43
00:03:39,581 --> 00:03:41,936
You can't wait to see it, right?

44
00:03:42,261 --> 00:03:45,014
Damn you, Grand Duke! So I
would have been crazy enough...

45
00:03:45,061 --> 00:03:47,780
...to let myself be bitten
by this stupid mutt, eh?

46
00:03:48,821 --> 00:03:50,732
Help!

47
00:04:00,901 --> 00:04:03,461
Hey, who put this rope here?

48
00:04:03,861 --> 00:04:07,171
This corridor is the shortest
way to get to my room.

49
00:04:22,461 --> 00:04:25,897
What a terrible dog! Attacking
from behind like that, all of a sudden!

50
00:04:31,901 --> 00:04:35,689
- Here we are! Here we are!
- Are you alright, Princess Sapphire?

51
00:04:35,741 --> 00:04:37,891
- Yes!
- We feared it had overwhelmed you!

52
00:04:39,581 --> 00:04:41,731
What a beast! It's
better to eliminate him!

53
00:04:42,621 --> 00:04:46,739
No, stop! Wait! I would like to
know who this dog belongs to...

54
00:04:46,781 --> 00:04:49,454
Hey! Why are you standing
around my fighting dog?

55
00:04:49,501 --> 00:04:51,412
- Is he yours?
- Of course, Prince!

56
00:04:51,461 --> 00:04:55,090
I raised him myself. This is
what I was telling you about.

57
00:04:55,181 --> 00:04:57,820
This, then, would
be the fun thing!

58
00:04:57,861 --> 00:05:00,011
- Lock him in a cell!
- Right away!

59
00:05:10,141 --> 00:05:14,293
Look, Prince: here is what is
defined as "a fighting dog."

60
00:05:29,821 --> 00:05:32,733
You are cruel, Grand Duke,
to treat a dog like that!

61
00:05:33,661 --> 00:05:37,654
Don't feel sorry for him! A
fighting dog must be raised this way.

62
00:05:37,701 --> 00:05:39,339
Come!

63
00:05:40,101 --> 00:05:42,012
Look in here.

64
00:05:42,821 --> 00:05:45,813
Do you see this dog?
Good, now pay attention.

65
00:05:45,861 --> 00:05:48,250
I will introduce his mother into the cell.

66
00:05:49,581 --> 00:05:52,334
Now watch closely what happens.

67
00:05:54,901 --> 00:05:58,860
Stop it! You are mother and
son! Don't maul each other!

68
00:05:58,901 --> 00:06:00,698
Stop!

69
00:06:03,021 --> 00:06:06,570
How violent they are! Couldn't
you make them into kinder dogs?

70
00:06:06,621 --> 00:06:10,500
No! That would be like betraying
their nature as fighting dogs, wouldn't it?

71
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:15,819
How sad not to love
one's own mother.

72
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:33,415
Doctor Uranaru, in your
opinion, is there a way...

73
00:06:33,460 --> 00:06:36,020
...to make the fighting
dog normal?

74
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:40,650
It's too late for them now,
they are already trained!

75
00:06:41,260 --> 00:06:43,570
I deplore this pastime!

76
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:48,694
Oh! Look at those beautiful tulips
already in bloom!

77
00:06:48,900 --> 00:06:52,371
- I grew them myself.
- Doctor Uranaru,

78
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:55,333
- may I go to the neighboring kingdom?
- To the neighboring kingdom?

79
00:06:56,140 --> 00:07:00,100
I promised Franz I'd bring him
the first tulips to bloom.

80
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:27,460
Halt! No passing through here!

81
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:32,850
Who are you to order me to stop?

82
00:07:32,940 --> 00:07:36,650
Who are you, instead? Don't you know
that Silverland begins here?

83
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:38,692
Get out of the way!

84
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:43,138
Do you want to act like a rogue?
Boys, let's get him!

85
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:04,660
You bunch of softies! Make way
for Jingisu, future knight!

86
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:07,216
I've heard there is
a brave Princess...

87
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:09,013
...named Sapphire,
in this kingdom!

88
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:11,017
Would you like to challenge the Princess?

89
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:14,770
Exactly! To become a knight
I must defeat a brave warrior...

90
00:08:14,820 --> 00:08:17,176
...and, since the bravest
of all is Sapphire,

91
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:20,657
it is she whom I intend to beat!
Show me the way!

92
00:08:45,901 --> 00:08:47,812
Here is the Princess!

93
00:08:48,701 --> 00:08:50,532
Ah, it is her!

94
00:08:51,741 --> 00:08:54,301
You are a border guard!
But what is happening?

95
00:08:54,341 --> 00:08:56,650
This man
wants to challenge you, Your Highness

96
00:08:56,821 --> 00:09:00,018
- What?!
- So you are Sapphire, aren't you?

97
00:09:00,061 --> 00:09:02,575
And who are you?
Why are you looking for me?

98
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:05,696
I want to challenge you to a duel!

99
00:09:05,741 --> 00:09:08,301
You are a famous knight,
despite being a girl,

100
00:09:08,341 --> 00:09:12,016
and I will be knighted
by my King if I defeat you.

101
00:09:12,061 --> 00:09:14,177
- En garde! - I cannot
fight against you.

102
00:09:14,221 --> 00:09:16,530
You are a foreigner
and you have done nothing to me.

103
00:09:16,581 --> 00:09:18,617
And besides, now, I am very busy.

104
00:09:18,661 --> 00:09:20,572
Then take them!

105
00:09:20,621 --> 00:09:23,089
The tulips that I was supposed to give to Franz!

106
00:09:23,301 --> 00:09:27,260
Very well, Jingisu! Since you have provoked me, I accept the challenge!

107
00:09:27,301 --> 00:09:29,417
Come on, put yourself on guard!

108
00:09:30,421 --> 00:09:33,015
Mother! Mother!

109
00:09:34,421 --> 00:09:37,219
They are just simple tulips! But what is the matter with you?

110
00:09:37,261 --> 00:09:39,729
These flowers remind me of my mother!

111
00:09:39,781 --> 00:09:43,217
Mother loved tulips so much and I loved her so much.

112
00:09:44,221 --> 00:09:46,018
Mother!

113
00:09:46,661 --> 00:09:48,379
Mother!

114
00:09:49,621 --> 00:09:51,373
Mother!

115
00:09:52,221 --> 00:09:54,098
Mother!

116
00:10:01,261 --> 00:10:03,729
Did your mother abandon you, perhaps?

117
00:10:03,781 --> 00:10:07,535
Yes! When my father died and
left us alone, I cried for a long time.

118
00:10:07,581 --> 00:10:09,890
My mother saw me crying
so much and she left...

119
00:10:09,941 --> 00:10:12,774
...saying that someone so
weak couldn't be her son.

120
00:10:12,821 --> 00:10:15,415
She abandoned me because she
wanted me to become stronger.

121
00:10:15,461 --> 00:10:18,021
I understand! So you
want to become a knight...

122
00:10:18,061 --> 00:10:20,621
...to restore your
family's honor.

123
00:10:20,821 --> 00:10:22,652
Watch out!

124
00:10:27,461 --> 00:10:31,340
Damn it, the Black Knight! Him
again! He followed me all the way here!

125
00:10:31,781 --> 00:10:35,217
He's been hunting me since I was
a child! Now I don't care about him!

126
00:10:37,101 --> 00:10:39,296
Now I must only think about beating you!

127
00:10:41,901 --> 00:10:44,540
Good! Now you are in my power!

128
00:10:46,181 --> 00:10:48,012
Oh, no...

129
00:11:01,261 --> 00:11:03,491
Damn, it's an avalanche!

130
00:12:10,661 --> 00:12:13,221
- Help!
- Help!

131
00:12:24,821 --> 00:12:26,812
Help!

132
00:12:31,701 --> 00:12:34,010
We're falling!

133
00:12:38,181 --> 00:12:40,217
Help!

134
00:12:48,101 --> 00:12:50,012
Jingisu!

135
00:12:51,021 --> 00:12:53,455
Jingisu, can you hear me?

136
00:13:04,421 --> 00:13:07,299
Jingisu, answer me!

137
00:13:08,021 --> 00:13:10,410
I'm here!

138
00:13:17,181 --> 00:13:19,251
Thank goodness, you're safe!

139
00:13:20,341 --> 00:13:22,536
Try to grab the rope!

140
00:13:25,541 --> 00:13:28,613
Leave me alone! I won't
allow my rival to help me!

141
00:13:28,661 --> 00:13:32,017
- Don't be stupid!
- Go away! I said I won't..

142
00:13:39,861 --> 00:13:41,897
.

143
00:13:43,301 --> 00:13:45,895
I see you're being reasonable.

144
00:13:45,941 --> 00:13:49,217
Now try to be so until the very end. Don't
think about the challenge and go back home!

145
00:13:50,141 --> 00:13:53,258
No way! I will fight
against you until the end!

146
00:13:56,821 --> 00:14:01,019
The rope is very strong,
so stay calm! You'll make it!

147
00:14:10,661 --> 00:14:14,017
Opal, why did you stop so suddenly?

148
00:14:15,021 --> 00:14:16,693
What is it?

149
00:14:17,421 --> 00:14:21,130
It's a black glove... It must have been
dropped by the knight who was spying on us.

150
00:14:31,781 --> 00:14:35,296
It's cold, isn't it, dear? Would
you like a sweet and a cup of tea?

151
00:14:35,341 --> 00:14:37,730
Oh, thank you, mother. You're very kind.

152
00:14:37,781 --> 00:14:41,296
- Why were you so deep in thought?
- I was thinking about this glove.

153
00:14:41,341 --> 00:14:44,333
- A black glove?
- Is it too big for you, mother?

154
00:14:44,381 --> 00:14:46,417
No, it's just right for me.

155
00:14:46,621 --> 00:14:49,738
Right?
Then the black knight is...

156
00:14:52,101 --> 00:14:54,695
Who is trying to force their way
into the castle?

157
00:14:57,741 --> 00:15:01,575
Damn it! I'll force my way through
if you don't let me pass!

158
00:15:03,421 --> 00:15:06,891
Capture that stranger!
Don't let him pass!

159
00:15:16,381 --> 00:15:18,451
Prince Sapphire, where are you?

160
00:15:18,501 --> 00:15:20,617
Step forward,
if you have the courage!

161
00:15:21,021 --> 00:15:23,012
Get out of the way!

162
00:15:23,341 --> 00:15:25,935
Come on, Prince!
Don't be a coward!

163
00:15:28,141 --> 00:15:31,577
You are foolish if you think
a rope is enough to stop me!

164
00:15:57,901 --> 00:16:01,257
Who is following me?
What are these dogs?!

165
00:16:02,701 --> 00:16:04,896
I'll show you, you filthy beasts!

166
00:16:08,021 --> 00:16:10,251
Go! Good!

167
00:16:11,341 --> 00:16:13,218
Take this!

168
00:16:29,581 --> 00:16:31,731
Jingisu is struggling with the dogs.

169
00:16:32,181 --> 00:16:35,014
Come on, you beasts!
You certainly don't scare me!

170
00:16:36,261 --> 00:16:38,013
Who's there?

171
00:16:40,181 --> 00:16:42,934
Come on, little dogs,
get back in your cells!

172
00:16:45,421 --> 00:16:48,811
I am Grand Duke Duralumin.
With whom do I have the pleasure of speaking?

173
00:16:48,861 --> 00:16:51,170
I am Jingisu,
from the kingdom of Bururu...

174
00:16:51,221 --> 00:16:53,894
...and I have come here to challenge
Princess Sapphire to a duel,

175
00:16:53,941 --> 00:16:56,819
So let me pass!
I have a letter of introduction..

176
00:16:56,861 --> 00:17:00,012
...signed by my King, which attests
to the reason for my challenge!

177
00:17:00,061 --> 00:17:02,017
Challenge Sapphire?!

178
00:17:03,021 --> 00:17:05,171
You seem more ferocious than my dogs!

179
00:17:05,221 --> 00:17:07,655
A knight cannot help but accept the challenge,

180
00:17:07,701 --> 00:17:10,693
when the challenger shows
a letter signed by a King.

181
00:17:10,941 --> 00:17:13,250
Come then! Take me to her

182
00:17:13,301 --> 00:17:15,292
There is no rush.
Come with me.

183
00:17:15,901 --> 00:17:18,734
The Grand Duke is right,
I must accept that challenge!

184
00:17:18,781 --> 00:17:21,136
Oh, no! Wait!
Wait, Princess!

185
00:17:21,181 --> 00:17:23,331
Let me go, Doctor Uranaru!

186
00:17:23,381 --> 00:17:27,010
Listen to me! Has that boy
perhaps harmed you?

187
00:17:27,061 --> 00:17:29,575
- No, but...
- And he doesn't hate you either.

188
00:17:29,621 --> 00:17:31,612
He is only following the rules
of knighthood,

189
00:17:31,661 --> 00:17:33,856
which obliges him to challenge
a famous knight...

190
00:17:33,901 --> 00:17:35,732
..to obtain his investiture!

191
00:17:35,781 --> 00:17:39,615
But how will I look in front of
everyone if I don't accept his challenge?

192
00:17:39,661 --> 00:17:42,221
But that's exactly the point!
If you don't accept,

193
00:17:42,261 --> 00:17:44,138
you will break a bad law!

194
00:17:44,181 --> 00:17:46,615
And a better one can be made,
don't you think?

195
00:18:04,381 --> 00:18:06,895
- Aren't you sleeping?
- I'm too nervous.

196
00:18:07,141 --> 00:18:09,530
Will I be able to fight her tomorrow?

197
00:18:10,221 --> 00:18:12,610
Of course! Now sleep peacefully.

198
00:18:12,781 --> 00:18:15,011
Don't worry.

199
00:18:15,421 --> 00:18:17,093
See you tomorrow!

200
00:18:23,621 --> 00:18:26,294
Who goes there?!
And what is this?

201
00:18:27,061 --> 00:18:30,417
A tulip! I can't help
but think of my mother...

202
00:18:30,461 --> 00:18:32,338
...when I see one.
- Jingisu!

203
00:18:32,381 --> 00:18:34,258
Jingisu, it's me: your mother!

204
00:18:34,301 --> 00:18:37,020
Mama! Mama, is it you?
Where are you? Mama!

205
00:18:37,061 --> 00:18:40,531
Jingisu, listen to your mother's
voice! Don't challenge Sapphire!

206
00:18:40,661 --> 00:18:43,698
Jingisu, you are not a dog.
It won't make you happy...

207
00:18:43,741 --> 00:18:47,256
fighting like a fighting
dog to obtain knighthood.

208
00:18:49,261 --> 00:18:53,573
Listen to me, Jingisu! You
were certainly not born to fight!

209
00:18:56,741 --> 00:19:00,256
It's too late, mother! In my
life I have fought strenuously...

210
00:19:00,301 --> 00:19:04,340
...against many people! By now this
is the only thing I know how to do.

211
00:19:04,701 --> 00:19:07,420
Mother! Where are you, mother?

212
00:19:08,301 --> 00:19:11,452
- What’s happening, Jingisu?
- What do you want?

213
00:19:15,501 --> 00:19:17,651
What do you want, Grand Duke Duralumin?

214
00:19:18,621 --> 00:19:21,260
- I see with pleasure that you are in good shape.
- What are you doing?

215
00:19:21,301 --> 00:19:24,020
I’m taking this stupid
flower from your hands.

216
00:19:24,101 --> 00:19:26,331
You are not a sissy!

217
00:19:26,741 --> 00:19:30,017
If you are so soft-hearted,
you will not defeat Sapphire.

218
00:19:30,061 --> 00:19:32,575
- You must be tougher!
- I will defeat her, instead!

219
00:19:32,621 --> 00:19:34,612
You will see what I am capable of!

220
00:19:35,421 --> 00:19:37,616
The trick didn't work.

221
00:19:38,541 --> 00:19:41,419
It seems I won't be
able to help but fight.

222
00:19:56,901 --> 00:20:02,339
- Prince Sapphire!
- Prince Sapphire!

223
00:20:06,741 --> 00:20:10,336
Prince Sapphire, where are you?

224
00:20:12,301 --> 00:20:16,180
What are you saying? Sapphire has
disappeared?! Where did she go, Doctor Uranaru?

225
00:20:16,821 --> 00:20:19,096
- I don't know!
- She ran away! She's afraid to fight!

226
00:20:19,141 --> 00:20:21,530
Perhaps the heir of
Silverland is a coward!

227
00:20:21,701 --> 00:20:24,613
Grand Duke Duralumin,
watch how you speak!

228
00:20:25,181 --> 00:20:27,137
Don't make me angry,
otherwise...

229
00:20:27,181 --> 00:20:30,298
With such a cowardly heir to the
throne, the kingdom is not safe!

230
00:20:30,901 --> 00:20:33,415
Oh, Lord!
Where could Sapphire have gone?

231
00:20:33,581 --> 00:20:35,856
- To tell the truth, she is...
- Really?!

232
00:20:36,501 --> 00:20:40,096
- Princess!
- Sapphire!

233
00:20:40,141 --> 00:20:42,814
Show yourself,
chicken-hearted Princess!

234
00:20:42,861 --> 00:20:45,898
Where have you hidden
yourself? Are you so afraid of me?

235
00:20:45,941 --> 00:20:48,250
Sapphire, don't be a coward!

236
00:20:49,741 --> 00:20:51,493
Come out!

237
00:21:03,901 --> 00:21:07,416
Heavens forbid! It's not
out of fear that I'm hiding!

238
00:21:14,181 --> 00:21:17,651
I've found you, Sapphire! It
wasn't by hiding in the dungeons..

239
00:21:17,701 --> 00:21:20,579
. ...that you could escape
me! Choose your weapon!

240
00:21:21,701 --> 00:21:24,852
Jingisu, please, give up
the idea of knighthood!

241
00:21:24,901 --> 00:21:27,335
I told you to take a weapon,
whichever one you want!

242
00:21:27,381 --> 00:21:29,815
- Or do you prefer to declare yourself defeated already?
- The whip!

243
00:21:30,941 --> 00:21:32,533
Let's go!

244
00:21:45,741 --> 00:21:47,811
Stop! Stop, Jingisu!

245
00:21:48,661 --> 00:21:51,221
- The Black Knight!
- But who are you?

246
00:21:52,941 --> 00:21:54,897
Mother! Mother!

247
00:21:55,861 --> 00:21:58,455
- Mother!
- Jingisu, my son.

248
00:21:58,501 --> 00:22:00,332
Mother!

249
00:22:00,621 --> 00:22:05,012
Forgive me. I sneaked into
the castle and saw everything.

250
00:22:05,061 --> 00:22:07,370
I followed you, disguised
as the Black Knight,

251
00:22:07,421 --> 00:22:10,538
to forge you through dangers
and to help you regain your honor,

252
00:22:10,581 --> 00:22:13,220
pushing you to fight
against brave men.

253
00:22:13,261 --> 00:22:15,729
But I have realized
how wrong I was..

254
00:22:15,781 --> 00:22:17,817
...and how I have
made you unhappy.

255
00:22:18,821 --> 00:22:20,812
Mother!

256
00:22:21,461 --> 00:22:23,417
Forgive me, my son!

257
00:22:25,301 --> 00:22:28,452
Damn it, the dog has become
a human being!

258
00:22:35,861 --> 00:22:37,897
My heartfelt thanks, Princess!

259
00:22:37,941 --> 00:22:40,774
You truly are the bravest.
I will not forget you, Sapphire.

260
00:22:40,821 --> 00:22:43,574
I thank you.
I won't forget you either!

261
00:22:43,621 --> 00:22:45,896
Goodbye and good luck!

262
00:23:20,821 --> 00:23:24,441
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

263
00:23:24,442 --> 00:23:27,802
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

264
